# 本机专属的 Windows 启动器与诊断导出：含本机绝对路径 / 安装盘符，一律不提交
# Machine-specific Windows launchers and diagnosis dumps stay out of the repository.
0-setup.bat
1-run.bat
2-test.bat
3-build.bat
4-release.bat
start-mineradio.bat
5-diag-wallpaper.bat
_dryrun-diag.bat
wallpaper-diagnosis.txt

# 外部程序误写到工作区的产物（如手动跑 Wallpaper Engine 时它按 CWD 落下日志）
# Artifacts external programs drop into the working directory (Wallpaper Engine writes its log
# relative to the CWD when launched by hand).
log.txt
wallpaper-diagnosis.log

# ⚠️ 汽水音乐官方客户端的专有二进制：bdms.node / metasecml.dll 等一律不得入库，
#    也不得随安装包分发（授权缓存默认在用户主目录 ~/.mineradio/qishui-native，不在仓库内）。
#    These guard the repository in case a local cache is ever pointed at the working directory.
# Proprietary SodaMusic client binaries must never be committed or shipped.
qishui-native/
*.node
bdms.node
metasecml.dll
metasecml.dylib
libmetasecml.so

# ⚠️ 洛雪自定义音源脚本：第三方脚本一律不得入库，也不得随安装包分发。
#    运行时的脚本仓库在 Electron userData 下的 custom-sources/，正常不会出现在仓库里；
#    这几条只为防止把测试用的 userData 目录指向工作区后误提交用户的音源列表。
# LX custom source scripts must never be committed or shipped with the installer. The live
# store lives in custom-sources/ under Electron userData; these lines only guard against a
# test userData directory being pointed at the working tree.
custom-sources/
*.user.js
